# Verification and quality bar

- Every chunk includes verifiable acceptance criteria, tests and a completion work record with commands and observed results, not predicted results.
- Prefer deterministic, offline fixtures and synthetic EEG. Test timestamps, gaps, reconnections, stale frames, corrupt frames and backpressure where applicable.
- Test raw recording independence from renderer/inference failures; replay must be equivalent to live processing for the same input and configuration.
- New numerical DSP/ML implementation needs ground-truth synthetic tests and cross-session evaluation as appropriate.
- CI status cannot certify scientific validity or electrical safety. Surface these as manual review gates.
